rosecution Officer Exam 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Vacancy Details Total : 300 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 10px\">\n<td style=\"width: 38.4496%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.723%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"106\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 48.7093%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"357\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>BPSC Prosecution Officer Eligibility 2026</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 10px\">\n<td style=\"width: 38.4496%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\">Prosecution Officer</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 12.723%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"106\">300</td>\n<td style=\"width: 48.7093%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"357\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Law (LLB 3 year / 5 Year) from Any Recognized University in India.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 10px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.8819%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>For Category Wise Vacancy Details Read the BPSC Prosecution Officer Notification 2026</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 10px\">\n<td style=\"width: 27.9943%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"171\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Exam Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 7.56875%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>UR</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.77309%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"63\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>EWS</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 7.23225%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"59\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>EBC</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 9.0989%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"64\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>BC</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 8.53095%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>BC Female</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 9.89393%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"65\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>SC</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 7.88382%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"55\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>ST</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.9059%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"113\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 10px\">\n<td style=\"width: 27.9943%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"171\">\n<p align=\"center\">Prosecution Officer under Home Department (Prosecution Directorate), Govt. of Bihar.</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 7.56875%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\">129</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.77309%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"63\">\n<p align=\"center\">29</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 7.23225%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"59\">64</td>\n<td style=\"width: 9.0989%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"64\">\n<p align=\"center\">25</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 8.53095%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">04</td>\n<td style=\"width: 9.89393%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"65\">\n<p align=\"center\">42</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 7.88382%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"55\">\n<p align=\"center\">07</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.9059%;height: 10px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"113\">\n<p align=\"center\">300</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 305px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.8819%;height: 227px\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>How to Fill BPSC <b>Prosecution Officer </b> Online Form 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bihar Public Service Commission BPSC Are Issued Prosecution Officer under Home Department (Prosecution Directorate), Govt. of Bihar.&nbsp;&nbsp;Recruitment Notification 2026 and Invited Online Application Form for the BPSC Bihar Prosecution Officer&nbsp; &nbsp;Jobs 2026 Candidate Can Apply Online for <b>27/02/2026 to 20/03/2026</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the BPSC Latest Prosecution Officer under Home Department (Prosecution Directorate), Govt. of Bihar. Application Form in Sarkari Result Recruitment Latest Job Section.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – ID, DOB Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Live Photo and Hindi / English Signature Required in BPSC APO Form 2025.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 13px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.8819%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full BPSC Prosecution Officer 2026 Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 10px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.8819%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 10px\">\n<td style=\"width: 51.1726%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 48.7093%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"357\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 10px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.8819%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b